  "summary": ".NET developer experienced in the development of web based and client server based applications using ASP.NET / VB.NET and C# on the 1.1, 2.0 and 3.5 Framework. \n\nHeavy experience in SQL server both from an administrative as well as a programming perspective. Versions worked with are SQL Server 2000, SQL Server 2005 and SQL Server 2008.\n\nAlso experienced in writing WPF applications using C# and LinQ as an ORM to the Database.\n\nData connectivity experienced is with ODBC, ADO, Linked Server, LINQ and Ado Entity Relationship. \n\nAlso experienced in I.T policy development and implementation around software development and I.T operations.\n\nSpecialties: IT. Policy development and implementation in order to achieve Sox or Jsox compliance.",
